(Nestack Cloud & System Architecture Overview) Tj
T* (Page 1: Core Infrastructure and Ingestion Services) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1.1 Introduction) Tj
T* (Nestack builds resilient enterprise data pipelines designed to process high-throughput unstructured documents. Our platform ingests multi-format documents, primarily PDF contracts, technical whitepapers, and operational logs, converting raw text into high-dimensional vector representations.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1.2 Text Ingestion Pipeline) Tj
T* (The document ingestion subsystem relies on PyMuPDF \(fitz\) to accurately extract text streams while maintaining explicit tracking of page numbers and document boundaries. Maintaining page numbers is critical for auditability and compliance, allowing engineers to verify sources directly.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1.3 Text Chunking Strategy) Tj
T* (Raw text is split into fixed-size overlapping chunks. A default window size of 500 characters with a 100-character overlap prevents contextual boundary loss across sentence transitions. Each chunk is assigned a unique identifier alongside page number metadata before vector encoding.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
