(Nestack Cloud & System Architecture Overview) Tj
T* (Page 3: FastAPI Retrieval API & Strict Guidelines) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3.1 Semantic Search vs Chatbots) Tj
T* (Nestack retrieval endpoints implement pure semantic search. Under no circumstances should the system invoke large language models \(LLMs\) to synthesize or hallucinate text answers. The API strictly queries the vector database and returns verbatim chunk text, page numbers, and scores.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3.2 FastAPI Query Endpoint Specification) Tj
T* (The service exposes a POST /query endpoint receiving a JSON payload containing the query string. The server encodes the incoming query with Sentence Transformers, performs top-k cosine similarity search across ChromaDB, and returns ranked chunk records with exact source attribution.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3.3 Response JSON Schema) Tj
T* (The response must conform to: chunk_text \(string\), page_number \(integer\), score \(float\). A higher score indicates greater semantic alignment between the user query and the source passage.) Tj
ET
endstream
